Title: Apache Traffic Server - Acknowledgements
		

# Acknowledgements #

The Apache Traffic Server team would like to acknowledge the support and 
contributions of the following companies, organizations and individuals:

* [Yahoo!](https://www.yahoo.com), for donating the original source code for the Apache Traffic Server to us.
* [Rackspace](https://www.rackspace.com), for providing virtualized resources to our Continuous Integration system.
* [GoDaddy](https://www.godaddy.com), for additional resources to our CI, as well as SSL certificates for our sites.
* [The Measurement Factory](https://www.measurement-factory.com/), for letting us run their Co-Advisor test suite against Apache Traffic Server.
* [Aviv Keller](https://github.com/redyetidev), for designing this awesome website
